833
00:45:07,240 --> 00:45:08,600
That's definitely one reason.

834
00:45:08,600 --> 00:45:10,520
When you have a large
offline data set,

835
00:45:10,520 --> 00:45:12,920
variance is a bit
less of a concern.

836
00:45:12,920 --> 00:45:15,800
And these are more accurate.

837
00:45:15,800 --> 00:45:19,920
That said, a big part of
