838
00:45:19,920 --> 00:45:23,650
And it's nice.

839
00:45:23,650 --> 00:45:25,400
Yeah, it's very nice
to have an algorithm,

840
00:45:25,400 --> 00:45:27,160
where you're doing
supervised learning

841
00:45:27,160 --> 00:45:28,420
to fit the value function.

842
00:45:28,420 --> 00:45:29,880
And then you're doing
weighted supervised learning

843
00:45:29,880 --> 00:45:31,040
to fit the policy.

844
00:45:31,040 --> 00:45:34,240
And it's just a very,
very simple algorithm.

845
00:45:34,240 --> 00:45:38,200
Next, we'll talk about slightly
more complicated algorithms

846
00:45:38,200 --> 00:45:44,380
than this version 1, right here,
that can also do a bit better.

847
00:45:44,380 --> 00:45:47,060
So it's still-- even when
you have an offline data set,

848
00:45:47,060 --> 00:45:48,820
there is variance.

849
00:45:48,820 --> 00:45:51,280
More variance in this
estimate than other estimates

850
00:45:51,280 --> 00:45:53,960
that we'll see in a minute.

851
00:45:53,960 --> 00:45:59,120
Now one question that
just to get your brains

852
00:45:59,120 --> 00:46:00,060
thinking a little bit.

