00:51:38,730 --> 00:51:44,370
So for this action,
a is equal to 7.

967
00:51:44,370 --> 00:51:48,010
For this one, a is
equal to negative 2.

968
00:51:48,010 --> 00:51:52,330
And for this one, a is
